  "notes": "Compound of {組|く}む (to put together) + {上|あ}げる (to complete, to finish). The {上|あ}げる component adds a sense of completion.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {部品|ぶひん}を{組|く}み{上|あ}げる: to assemble parts\n- システムを{組|く}み{上|あ}げる: to build a system\n- {計画|けいかく}を{組|く}み{上|あ}げる: to put together a plan\n- {一|いち}から{組|く}み{上|あ}げる: to build from scratch\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {組|く}み{立|た}てる: to assemble (more mechanical/factory-like)\n- {組|く}み{上|あ}げる: to build up (emphasizes completion, more creative)",
